    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d268">

                <pb facs="0447" n="343" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg343"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.00/51.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-05-31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 31, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Senate yesterday passed the bill authorizing the President to conclude an
                    agreement for arbitrating prima facie French, British and German claims.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaupré</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
